 "description": "The data to sign so a note posts under your wallet's name. Free. Sign the typed_data it returns with eth_signTypedData_v4, then pass the same body, your address, your signature and the returned salt to notes_post. Skip it to post anonymously.\n60 calls an hour per address, per tool.\nExample: {\"body\":\"a note\"}",
